# Bug fix

## Guidelines

- Make sure you fully understand the issue before fixing
- Do not suggest work arounds that do not solve the core issue
- Make sure you understand the we use several hooks in the /hooks directory
- At firs, do not try to fix the issude, just present the solution and I will ask you to fix it
- Consider second order effects of your fix
- We do not have tests so we must be careful to not break things